71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tb26x0m36C8Q7kNvwFGFAUf&_nc_oc=AdqAv5u_O2rX3O2w4jmh3fseI65jHLWkjPpxuHBdUIPkUqS-3A2K4J7W8ymeFk7wd1k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBP80t6oJCZSBw27td8NlSig5rEHpsAuL0SmE6KcIUR5Q&oe=6A539239"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xbg41SJs7a4Q7kNvwEwr18l&_nc_oc=Adp38eKWNiZpeZyhLmOSkh6kTCVW568XZLQZens6qn2cCfBu6Qaefo-DTh6mv4jYwxg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAiu1klhZsBxrnqQgsnqYoP1rSNa5T4RMxI4N9vinYMmg&oe=6A53A513"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qxS3csETIhAQ7kNvwFW8Mz4&_nc_oc=AdrSgSlu-E8ZRZZ5xoUgMkkniuJFIdpcXuZTaui7uRbmpOA3hz8C28UWKig6Sito3Xs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCdtLqymG_jrYXFGIQuA2zfqu6RvcUV1INcH7MoJX7bPQ&oe=6A53A35A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: